  "name": "Example: Translating Between Phrases and Algebraic Expressions Containing Division",
  "problem": "Translate the phrase \"the quotient of a number and seven\" into an algebraic expression.",
  "worked_solution": "\"The quotient of a number and seven\" means the same thing as \"a number divided by seven.\" If we call our number $x,$ then we can express this mathematically as $\\dfrac{x}{7}.$",
